  "created": "2026-11-24T12:00:24.073Z",
  "description": "A C# port of the parts of ICU4J 79.1 that Lucene's ICU analysis module needs: Unicode character properties and scripts (UScript), UnicodeSet, Normalizer2 (NFC/NFKC/NFKC_Casefold and custom .nrm data, FilteredNormalizer2), and RuleBasedBreakIterator over compiled .brk rules or rules compiled at run time, with ICU's dictionary break engines for Thai, Lao, Khmer, Burmese and Chinese/Japanese, case mapping, character names, Transliterator with all of ICU's system transforms and custom rules, and collation (Collator/RuleBasedCollator with CLDR root and locale tailorings, rule strings, sort keys). Ships the ICU 79.1 data files it reads. Licensed Unicode-3.0, separately from the Apache-2.0 LuceneSharp packages.",
